{"slug":"h-l-k","ar":"ه ل ك","total":68,"core":"destruction; perishing","forms":[{"ar":"أَهْلَكَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":51,"gloss":"to destroy","word":null,"ex":{"s":77,"a":16,"p":2,"ar":["أَلَمْ","نُهْلِكِ","ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ"],"en":"Did We not destroy the former peoples"}},{"ar":"هَلَكَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":5,"gloss":"to perish, die","word":null,"ex":{"s":69,"a":29,"p":1,"ar":["هَلَكَ","عَنِّى","سُلْطَـٰنِيَهْ"],"en":"Gone from me is my authority"}},{"ar":"مُهْلِك","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":5,"gloss":"destroyer","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":131,"p":6,"ar":["ذَٰلِكَ","أَن","لَّمْ","يَكُن","رَّبُّكَ","مُهْلِكَ","ٱلْقُرَىٰ","بِظُلْمٍ","وَأَهْلُهَا","غَـٰفِلُونَ"],"en":"That is because your Lord would not destroy the cities for wrongdoing while their people were unaware"}},{"ar":"هَالِك","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"perishing, those who perish","word":null,"ex":{"s":12,"a":85,"p":12,"ar":["قَالُوا۟","تَٱللَّهِ","تَفْتَؤُا۟","تَذْكُرُ","يُوسُفَ","حَتَّىٰ","تَكُونَ","حَرَضًا","أَوْ","تَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْهَـٰلِكِينَ"],"en":"They said, \"By Allah, you will not cease remembering Joseph until you become fatally ill or become of those who perish"}},{"ar":"مَهْلِك","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"destruction","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":59,"p":7,"ar":["وَتِلْكَ","ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ","أَهْلَكْنَـٰهُمْ","لَمَّا","ظَلَمُوا۟","وَجَعَلْنَا","لِمَهْلِكِهِم","مَّوْعِدًا"],"en":"And those cities - We destroyed them when they wronged, and We made for their destruction an appointed time"}},{"ar":"مُهْلَكِين","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"destroyed","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":48,"p":4,"ar":["فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا","فَكَانُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلْمُهْلَكِينَ"],"en":"So they denied them and were of those destroyed"}},{"ar":"مُهْلِكِى","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"destroyer","word":null,"ex":{"s":28,"a":59,"p":16,"ar":["وَمَا","كَانَ","رَبُّكَ","مُهْلِكَ","ٱلْقُرَىٰ","حَتَّىٰ","يَبْعَثَ","فِىٓ","أُمِّهَا","رَسُولًا","يَتْلُوا۟","عَلَيْهِمْ","ءَايَـٰتِنَا ۚ","وَمَا","كُنَّا","مُهْلِكِى","ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ","إِلَّا","وَأَهْلُهَا","ظَـٰلِمُونَ"],"en":"And never would your Lord have destroyed the cities until He had sent to their mother a messenger reciting to them Our verses. And We would not destroy the cities except while their people were wrongdoers"}},{"ar":"تَّهْلُكَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"ruin, destruction","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":195,"p":9,"ar":["وَأَنفِقُوا۟","فِى","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَلَا","تُلْقُوا۟","بِأَيْدِيكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلتَّهْلُكَةِ ۛ","وَأَحْسِنُوٓا۟ ۛ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"en":"And spend in the way of Allah and do not throw [yourselves] with your [own] hands into destruction [by refraining]. And do good; indeed, Allah loves the doers of good"}}],"surahs":[[7,6],[28,6],[6,5],[8,3],[17,3],[21,3],[69,3],[2,2],[18,2],[19,2],[20,2],[26,2],[46,2],[3,1],[4,1],[5,1],[9,1],[10,1],[11,1],[12,1],[14,1],[15,1],[22,1],[23,1],[27,1],[29,1],[32,1],[36,1],[38,1],[40,1],[43,1],[44,1],[45,1],[47,1],[50,1],[53,1],[54,1],[67,1],[77,1],[90,1]]}